 the BEST in its GENRE @Frenchblues","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":217,"year":null,"note":null,"total":730,"scaruffi":null},{"id":4389278164509,"name":"Music Genre Tree","src":"musthear","grp":"musicbrainz","list_year":null,"rank":993,"year":null,"note":null,"total":1042,"scaruffi":null}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This album is described as one of the most evocative, dark, and melancholic electronic albums. It transforms the urban present into a landscape haunted by memories and futures that never materialized. Burial's music samples and imitates the \"rave era,\" or rather its echo, featuring urban rhythms cloaked in rain, fragmented voices lost in fog, breaking glass on asphalt, R&B, UK garage, and 2-step sounds that drag like blurry memories. It serves as an echo of a rave culture that was already disappearing in the early 2000s. \"Su álbum Man True, además de ser uno de los discos más evocadores, oscuros y melancólicos de la electrónica, convierte el presento urbano en un pésage implujado por memorias y futuros que nunca llegaron.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"El Género Musical Más Escalofriante de Internet. Hauntología","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jcvyJLgYcg"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"Considered by the speaker to be the best album of the 21st century, \"Untrue\" is described as magical and a masterpiece of modern music. It showcases Burial's unique blend of simple rhythmic structures with profound emotional depth. \"el mejor disco que ha habido en el siglo XXI es este Andrew de Burial este disco es mágico.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"The first track of \"Untrue\" serves as a prime example of Burial's technique of integrating almost subliminal, diffused, low, and desynchronized sounds into his music, which are barely audible but contribute significantly to the overall atmosphere. \"la primera pista del antrú que es casi no se oye es como un ejemplo de todos esos sonidos que le mete burial de fondo a las canciones.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"This album extensively features samples from video games, particularly over 30 distinct sounds from \"Metal Gear Solid,\" including weapon reloads, intros, and gunshots. These elements are reprocessed by Burial to create entirely new sonic textures. \"en el antrús se han recogido como más de 30 sonidos que tienen sacados el pues por ejemplo el arma que se recarga o cuando hay una intro o cuando hay un disparo.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Best 21st Century Album","body":"Considered by the speaker to be the best album of the 21st century, \"Untrue\" is described as magical and a masterpiece of modern music. It showcases Burial's unique blend of simple rhythmic structures with profound emotional depth. \"el mejor disco que ha habido en el siglo XXI es este Andrew de Burial este disco es mágico.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Subliminal Sound Integration","body":"The first track of \"Untrue\" serves as a prime example of Burial's technique of integrating almost subliminal, diffused, low, and desynchronized sounds into his music, which are barely audible but contribute significantly to the overall atmosphere. \"la primera pista del antrú que es casi no se oye es como un ejemplo de todos esos sonidos que le mete burial de fondo a las canciones.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Video Game Samples","body":"This album extensively features samples from video games, particularly over 30 distinct sounds from \"Metal Gear Solid,\" including weapon reloads, intros, and gunshots. These elements are reprocessed by Burial to create entirely new sonic textures. \"en el antrús se han recogido como más de 30 sonidos que tienen sacados el pues por ejemplo el arma que se recarga o cuando hay una intro o cuando hay un disparo.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BURIAL. El genio.","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LzsYe6KJ3MA"}]}],"book_tracks":[{"id":202062724449867,"artist":"Burial","artist_id":14571947825848,"title":"Untrue","year":2007,"ess":1,"yt":"GrChfkWDq9o","kind":null,"book":{"id":10,"title":"Loops 1 y 2. Una historia de la música electrónica","author":"Javier Blánquez (ed.)","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/"},"scene":"Dubstep","scene_id":55791901681639,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/loops_timeline/#dubstep","chapters":["Loops 2 · Cap. 4: Guerreros del dub: el continuum rave en Gran Bretaña, grime, dubstep y la cristalización de un nuevo paradigma rítmico"],"pages":[[2,134],[2,427]]}],"others":[{"id":109466950484902,"type":"album","name":"Burial","year":2006,"weight":22},{"id":251508095545728,"type":"album","name":"Kindred","year":2012,"weight":17},{"id":141427867142043,"type":"song","name":"Flame 1","year":2018,"weight":10},{"id":193074248782240,"type":"album","name":"Rival Dealer","year":2013,"weight":8},{"id":265819031497924,"type":"work","name":"Truant","year":2012,"weight":6},{"id":242353445156860,"type":"work","name":"Etched Headplate","year":2007,"weight":6},{"id":209680808832805,"type":"work","name":"Shell of Light","year":2007,"weight":6},{"id":206164966624963,"type":"work","name":"Prayer","year":2006,"we